<title>SWEDEN: Sweden reverse repo drains 56 bln SKR from market.</title>
<headline>Sweden reverse repo drains 56 bln SKR from market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, on Tuesday drained 56 billion crowns from the market in the morning's reverse repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The reverse repo was set at an unchanged fixed 4.60 percent and will run from November 13 to November 20, replacing an operation that drained 54 billion crowns from the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 13.18 percent of bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockhom newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
